# Order Management System API

A comprehensive ASP.NET Core REST API for managing orders with Entity Framework Core and SQL Server, featuring API versioning and Swagger documentation.

## Features

✅ Complete CRUD operations for Orders
✅ API Versioning (v1.0)
✅ Swagger/OpenAPI Documentation
✅ Entity Framework Core with SQL Server
✅ Repository Pattern Implementation
✅ Dependency Injection
✅ Async/Await Operations

## Project Structure

```
OrderManagementSystem/
├── Models/
│   └── Order.cs                 # Order entity model
├── Data/
│   └── ApplicationDbContext.cs  # EF Core DbContext
├── Repositories/
│   └── OrderRepository.cs       # Data access layer
├── Controllers/
│   └── OrderController.cs       # API endpoints (v1)
├── Program.cs                   # Application configuration
├── appsettings.json            # Configuration file
└── test-orders.http            # REST API test requests
```

